<title>USA: United Dominion sees Q2 divestiture gain.</title>
<headline>United Dominion sees Q2 divestiture gain.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Dominion Industries Ltd said Wednesday that it anticipates recording a gain in the second quarter on the sale and the previously announced divestiture of its Windsor Door and Centria building products units.</p>
<p>Separately, United Dominion also announced an agreement in principle to sell its Varco-Pruden Buildings Division to LTV Corp for $187.5 million in cash.</p>
</text>
